# Omni Demo — Full Implementation Plan

## What We're Building

```
omni-demo-app (React + TypeScript + Vite)
        ↓ GitHub Actions CI fails
        ↓ GitHub sends workflow_run webhook
        ↓
Omni (github-logs-pipeline on Render)
        ↓ fetches + filters logs
        ↓ forwards to nova-incident-router
        ↓
Amazon Nova classifies the failure
        ↓
Router decides: retry / alert / rollback
        ↓
Slack → specific diagnosis message
Dashboard → live update
```

